# T21 (Q9): Loading → Intro from the menu after the menu warm-up, plus a restart and a repeat load.
# Run with a build that warms up in automated runs (T20c's measurement build; the tested build skips
# the menu warm-up in automated runs, so it measures the synchronous path instead):
# Title → 50 s idle (the warm-up takes ~32 s) → Quick Race on Toy Town → GO → pause → Restart → GO
# → pause → Quit → Car select → Track select → Backyard Bash (first outdoor load) → GO → pause →
# Quit → Car select → race again (repeat load) → GO → exit. Loads: log_scan.py on the log.
wait ui
wait screen title
50 nav keyboardA confirm           # Title (after the menu warm-up)
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # Toy Town (focused): select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
2.0 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
wait racing
2.0 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # How to play
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quit race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # dialog: Cancel focused
0.4 nav keyboardA left             # Quit
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen carSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA back             # → Track select (Toy Town selected and focused)
wait screen trackSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # race (first outdoor load)
wait racing
2.0 tap keyboardA pause
wait screen pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quit race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.4 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen carSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # the same race again (repeat load)
wait racing
2.0 exit
